 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Lovely. Do you usually walk him on a leash? No problem. So, is the dog used to walking on a leash? Oh, sorry. In that case, I'd head out without him on a short trial run. He' be excited to see everyone and expect to go where you go. Start at the back of the garden and work in. No worries. He might take a few sandwiches as he gets the hang of it. A long toy in his mouth can help too.",
